Apply the three operations below to the input document, using the supplied edit rules. Return only the complete resulting JSON object. Do not use tools.

Input: {"meta":{"revision":4,"approved":false,"owner":"Mira"},"items":[{"id":"A","value":3,"active":true},{"id":"B","value":8,"active":false}],"note":"keep"}

Operations in order: (1) set items/1/value to the JSON number 9; (2) set meta/approved to the JSON boolean true; (3) set items/0/active to the JSON boolean false.
